      "mergedPostDetails": "When I move an instance with a friend, I rarely block my friend.\n\n Even though I haven't done anything to block them, it says that I've blocked them, and I can't see them.\n\n But my friend seemed to be able to see me.\n\nWhen I re-entered the instance, the abnormal state in which I blocked my friend was released, and I was able to see my friend.",
